        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSBTL, Solid Brass Large Ball Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The large Ball finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: For use</b> with large  <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"><b>6\" x 6\" Brass Hinges</b></a> only.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. <b>Order 2 finials per hinge</b>, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana large Ball Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>10mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<li>For use with the Deltana DSB66BB 6\" Heavy Duty Solid Brass Hinge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PVD  Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: For use</b> with large  <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"><b>6\" x 6\" Brass Hinges</b></a> only.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Ball Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSBTL",
                "description": "Deltana DSBTL large Ball Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The large Ball cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in 9 finishes.",
